      "words_sha256": "53574e41d5a817ac911cc9d17108a459d7e6e190e3be47a00a32b49c70590a7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2f3d2dda43cf651dabec557f75177d189f6946ff7df303c5fa2d858eed4195d0",
      "request_id": "2f3d2dda43cf651dabec557f75177d189f6946ff7df303c5fa2d858eed4195d0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ed5f8606eaedc918fdf1b123ffd47a24",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "温网第四轮，她又两盘输给大坂直美。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ec4798067fe62bf0302e601c6232e5c83d3afb77ac6ac578e80c9135efc4aba8",
      "words_sha256": "449c7c9ca440cecbb8a30dbc5e9e61260f6056e5a66321836223cbbcd7df1403"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:30ef2555c5c13f5ef32e873411f1028056ffe953ab55e3590e756af408c55cfe",
      "request_id": "30ef2555c5c13f5ef32e873411f1028056ffe953ab55e3590e756af408c55cfe",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e7a6ee91b4536757b210d1d387c324ff",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网，她重新走进决赛。对面还是莱巴金娜。三盘之后，她又是亚军。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f84e6fc86b06ac03bc9a96d29a93b2ecc8c47edf2cc3bee2bb0134fda063c373",
      "words_sha256": "329d953d4550f94aed5c64dc2ad9e7e6e46364dd17e67be2d9505ca55f1c2fce"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:349e7b8944efa6caf95cd7062312d0164c5e803bd667359013618523338df9b0",
      "request_id": "349e7b8944efa6caf95cd7062312d0164c5e803bd667359013618523338df9b0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "843c4e5e6d89c663bdb6ca95920c6ee7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "马德里，六个赛点都没能兑现。巴普蒂斯特结束了她的十五连胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2878747cc838566e63f743fa3e9d17b1a447f8d19f397d147325e7c38a3cf305",
      "words_sha256": "22b2d9127e7de4e0edba6d0dbda6881e3df72daefb2b921083841d82345870dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:49428ec527ddb3bf382bda7b7059c7ddce9e92118a7ef4711e352a4782ccde7e",
      "request_id": "49428ec527ddb3bf382bda7b7059c7ddce9e92118a7ef4711e352a4782ccde7e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "35e487050769cb313027309945370da5",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "武汉，她先赢一盘，第二盘一度四比二领先。决胜盘，她救回九个赛点，最终仍没能获胜。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e729ad8d5d716acd9da2ced23d91119099459267d76d0bd0aa66daeb1087dda5",
      "words_sha256": "a1c4e4d17b7502b9129e7835f06b9642364217842af612c85b607cd8b1232e39"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:5d503caff7edb942bac13b3e887a49790fbbe08d70322f310100af88e84e143a",
      "request_id": "5d503caff7edb942bac13b3e887a49790fbbe08d70322f310100af88e84e143a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "de9b6b5cde8f0f2232cb207b7832d395",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "罗马第三轮出局。法网，她先赢一盘，第二盘又以四比一领先。但从五比三开始，她连丢最后十局，止步8强。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "487dbaa400c1c50c94a13a26f566865e68446b23c4b00fe45add7cebd60ae173",
      "words_sha256": "3a23c47faf462427341d5ee5bf814d7e8150b08aa454043052c4a76728ad4191"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:61344bae0690200d390d28099b7b37827e1dc9c3bb8e90809a71a173dd55d101",
      "request_id": "61344bae0690200d390d28099b7b37827e1dc9c3bb8e90809a71a173dd55d101",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "afe88f2efdc3bfbb96b9f81e04584917",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "两周后，她在迈阿密击败高芙，成功卫冕。印第安维尔斯和迈阿密，两座冠军连在了一起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d4c3a7f3f5b86b2301eaea40b30569dcfc6ff027204f7545e31861230243a20e",
      "words_sha256": "219b32bb4ff8463305e7b2fdfd0cd9aa1fe49cfaa9cdd40acdf0354db8e0cbff"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6a7e3ad6ea54f46303a0ac8591611def06ba0aef40fac161d9f9e92c87d86e1c",
      "request_id": "6a7e3ad6ea54f46303a0ac8591611def06ba0aef40fac161d9f9e92c87d86e1c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "39494c226779ce0f763dca2aa7625294",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三月，印第安维尔斯决赛，又是莱巴金娜。先丢一盘，决胜盘抢七，她又面对冠军点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b8f1295e2475804f92fbc2023faa1a8fffc108063d2cbd03979a71038a3c2d27",
